# Looking at the document box for the first time: Lino notices the old delivery
# label under the tape, and the flag that goes up is what unlocks the option in
# the clerk's conversation.
#
# A sequence and not a hotspot line because a line cannot raise a flag, and this
# is a look that changes the world. Two steps is a small scene, but the closed
# list of step kinds is exactly what makes a small one cheap.
#
# Guarded by sequence_if on the hotspot (!saw_delivery_label), so it plays once
# and every later look falls through to the ordinary description.

uid baggaseqaptl01

say  SEQ_APT_LABEL
flag saw_delivery_label
